// Fork (giantswarm/phemera): Renovate is off here on purpose. This line is
// upstream phemera-dev/phemera `main` plus the fork's own files, so upstream
// owns the dependency graph (its Dependabot configuration); a bump opened here
// would diverge from upstream and every sync would have to carry or revert
// it. Dependencies move when upstream moves them; see FORK.md.
{
  $schema: 'https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json',
  enabled: false,
}
